                <head>341. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>On October 13, during the 261st meeting of the National Security Council,
                    Secretary Dulles briefly discussed the
                    situation in Iran. For portions of the memorandum of discussion pertaining to
                    the Middle East, see <ref target="#d68">Document 68</ref>.</p>
            </div>
